{
  "id": "a1-m04-l3",
  "version": 1,
  "level": "A1",
  "module": 4,
  "order": 3,
  "title": "Mening oilam: egalik so'zlari",
  "title_de": "Meine Familie: mein, dein, unser",
  "goal": "Dars oxirida mein, dein, sein, ihr, unser, euer, Ihr so'zlarini otning jinsiga mos (mein/meine) ishlatasiz va oilangiz haqida 5–6 gaplik qisqa hikoya aytib yoza olasiz.",
  "skill_focus": [
    "grammar",
    "writing",
    "speaking"
  ],
  "explanation": [
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Egalik so'zi \"kimning?\" savoliga javob beradi: mening, sening, uning ... O'zbek tilida bu qo'shimcha bilan (-im, -ing), nemis tilida esa ot oldidagi so'z bilan ifodalanadi: mein Vater — otam."
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "headers": [
        "Kim?",
        "der / das otlar",
        "die otlar va ko'plik"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "ich",
          "mein Vater",
          "meine Mutter, meine Eltern"
        ],
        [
          "du",
          "dein Bruder",
          "deine Schwester"
        ],
        [
          "er",
          "sein Sohn",
          "seine Tochter"
        ],
        [
          "sie (u, ayol)",
          "ihr Mann",
          "ihre Kinder"
        ],
        [
          "wir",
          "unser Opa",
          "unsere Oma"
        ],
        [
          "ihr",
          "euer Hund",
          "eure Katze"
        ],
        [
          "Sie",
          "Ihr Kind",
          "Ihre Familie"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Qoida oddiy: egalik so'zi \"ein\" kabi o'zgaradi — die-ot va ko'plik oldida oxiriga -e qo'shiladi: mein → meine, unser → unsere, euer → eure."
    },
    {
      "type": "tip",
      "text": "O'zbekcha \"uning\" ikkala jins uchun bitta, nemis tilida esa egasiga qarab tanlanadi: Jasur und sein Sohn (Jasur va uning o'g'li), Malika und ihr Sohn (Malika va uning o'g'li)."
    },
    {
      "type": "tip",
      "text": "\"Ihr\" (katta harf) — Sizning (rasmiy): Ist das Ihr Hund? \"ihr\" (kichik harf) — uning (ayol) yoki ularning."
    }
  ],
